{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29152","headline":"湖南徐明府余之南邻久不还家因题林馆 · 许浑","name":"湖南徐明府余之南邻久不还家因题林馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘南官罢不归来，高阁经年掩绿苔。\n鱼溢池塘秋雨过，鸟还洲岛暮潮回。\n阶前石稳棋终局，窗外山寒酒满杯。\n借问先生独何处，一篱疎菊又花开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}